      "finalAnswer": "Option A: (v\u2081 - v\u2082) / (v\u2082 - v\u2083) = (t\u2081 + t\u2082) / (t\u2082 + t\u2083)",
      "whyOtherOptionsWrong": "Option C ignores that the time difference between the midpoints includes both intervals."
