    "question": "A parachutist bails out from an aeroplane and drops freely for 50 m without friction. When the parachute opens, he decelerates at 2 m/s\u00b2 and reaches the ground with speed 3 m/s. If g = 10 m/s\u00b2, what is the total height from which he bailed out?",
